{"unit_id":"kbpoyo__dsh-image-bridge#card-zh","repo":"kbpoyo/dsh-image-bridge","commit":"6c4d6e2dbda40ff2b5dee956b8cdc442017af3ca","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-bridge 是一个面向 DSH Web 的图片桥接插件，让不支持图片输入的文本模型也能处理用户粘贴或拖入的图片。它在对话输入区提供桥接发送按钮，并包装会话发送入口；插件会把图片保存到会话工作区，再将图片路径和处理指引作为文本交给模型。主要功能包括区分支持图片的模型并让其原生直通、桥接纯文本模型的图片、保留用户提问、校验图片数量和大小，以及按时间与目录容量清理临时图片。模型需要自行具备可用的视觉技能或工具。适合在 DSH Web 中使用纯文本模型处理图片的场景；代码未要求额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:15-24","lib/index.js:60-100","lib/index.js:183-260","lib/index.js:300-348","lib/client.js:48-68","package.json:16-23"]}
{"unit_id":"kbpoyo__dsh-image-bridge#card-en","repo":"kbpoyo/dsh-image-bridge","commit":"6c4d6e2dbda40ff2b5dee956b8cdc442017af3ca","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-image-bridge lets text-only models handle pasted images in DSH Web. It adds an input button and adapts image messages by saving them in the session workspace and sending paths as text. Image-capable models pass through. It checks image limits and prunes files. Models need their own vision tools.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:15-24","lib/index.js:60-100","lib/index.js:183-260","lib/index.js:300-348","lib/client.js:48-68","package.json:16-23"]}
