{"unit_id":"kbpoyo__dsh-image-bridge#feature-1","repo":"kbpoyo/dsh-image-bridge","commit":"6c4d6e2dbda40ff2b5dee956b8cdc442017af3ca","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-bridge 的功能「输入区桥接发送」：为纯文本模型下含图片的草稿显示按钮。点击后读取草稿图片和文本，经桥接服务保存并作为后续消息发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:48-68","lib/client.js:153-199","lib/index.js:263-293"]}
{"unit_id":"kbpoyo__dsh-image-bridge#feature-2","repo":"kbpoyo/dsh-image-bridge","commit":"6c4d6e2dbda40ff2b5dee956b8cdc442017af3ca","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-bridge 的功能「发送入口自动桥接」：纯文本模型收到含图消息时，包装器把图片保存到工作区，并将图片标记与原提问转成文本后继续发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:300-348"]}
{"unit_id":"kbpoyo__dsh-image-bridge#feature-3","repo":"kbpoyo/dsh-image-bridge","commit":"6c4d6e2dbda40ff2b5dee956b8cdc442017af3ca","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-bridge 的功能「多模态图片直通」：读取当前模型的输入模态；模型支持 image 时，输入按钮不用于桥接，自动发送流程也沿用原始请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:118-136","lib/index.js:320-332","lib/client.js:66-68"]}
{"unit_id":"kbpoyo__dsh-image-bridge#feature-4","repo":"kbpoyo/dsh-image-bridge","commit":"6c4d6e2dbda40ff2b5dee956b8cdc442017af3ca","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-bridge 的功能「图片限制校验」：保存前检查附件服务提供的图片数量、媒体类型、单张大小和消息总大小限制；不符合条件时返回对应错误。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:212-239"]}
{"unit_id":"kbpoyo__dsh-image-bridge#feature-5","repo":"kbpoyo/dsh-image-bridge","commit":"6c4d6e2dbda40ff2b5dee956b8cdc442017af3ca","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-bridge 的功能「临时图片清理」：桥接图片保存在会话工作区的隐藏目录，清理超过 24 小时的文件，并在目录超过目标容量时删除较旧文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:26-28","lib/index.js:60-64","lib/index.js:76-100"]}
{"unit_id":"kbpoyo__dsh-image-bridge#caveat-1","repo":"kbpoyo/dsh-image-bridge","commit":"6c4d6e2dbda40ff2b5dee956b8cdc442017af3ca","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-bridge 使用前须知：桥接图像会写入会话工作区的 .dsh-image-bridge 目录，清理周期为 24 小时，超出 512 MB 时也会清理较旧文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:26-28","lib/index.js:60-64","lib/index.js:76-100"]}
